Source landscape: Discovery found a substantial, polarized documentary universe spanning official financial disclosures, NARA/DOJ records, congressional investigations, ethics materials, fact-checking, promise trackers, polling, and investigative journalism. The strongest source families concern classified-records handling, Biden-family business allegations and counter-findings, ethics waivers, public statements, corrections, and promise implementation. Search results were treated as leads only; no claims or scores were extracted.

